        "color": "#f1e8e8",
        "borderColor": "#c1121f",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "altText": "Vintage expedition dossier featuring Indiana Jones's silhouette, fedora and whip, with his name, profession, era, and defining quotation.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Costume and Its Props\n\n### The Suit\nA baggy silver costume with orange pompoms, and a ruffled collar worn like a joke.\n\n### The Balloon\nA red balloon, offered to a child. It is bait, and it is always the same colour.\n\n### The Voice\nA friendly, sing-song voice, or any voice that will make a child stop and listen.\n\n### The Drains\nStorm drains and sewers: the doorways to a lair beneath the whole town.\n\n### The Deadlights\nIts true gaze: orange lights that drive a person mad if they look into them.\n\n---\n\n**Field philosophy:** A friendly face is the cheapest lure there is."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "a172891e-0c46-4340-8f33-cbc257b6bd7e"
        },
