      "style": {
        "background": "#1a1013",
        "color": "#f1e8e8",
        "borderColor": "#c1121f",
        "borderWidth": 2,
        "borderStyle": "solid",
        "borderRadius": 14
      },
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "altText": "Vintage expedition dossier featuring Indiana Jones's silhouette, fedora and whip, with his name, profession, era, and defining quotation.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Prey, Rivals and Pawns\n\n### The Losers' Club\n**The Seven Who Stand Up to It**\n\nSeven outcasts who face It as children, and come back together as adults to finish the job.\n\n### Bill Denbrough\n**Rival / Leader of the Losers**\n\nA stuttering boy whose grief over his little brother turns into the courage that leads the fight.\n\n### Beverly Marsh\n**Rival / The Group's Fighter**\n\nQuick, fearless and fiercely loyal to the friends who make her braver.\n\n### Henry Bowers\n**Unwitting Pawn**\n\nA cruel bully whom It steers and uses, without a thought for what happens to him.\n\n### Derry\n**Home / Accomplice**\n\nA town that keeps its worst secrets, so the feeding can go on."
        },
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "a172891e-0c46-4340-8f33-cbc257b6bd7e"
        },
        "documentOrder": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "52dec0a4-e527-4481-b697-70abc7f1961e",
